## Feature summary (web, SideFX reference)

- Source: https://www.sidefx.com/docs/houdini/nodes/cop/channelsplit.html
- Summary (EN): Divides a multichannel layer, VDB or attribute into four separate Mono outputs (red, green, blue, alpha) so each channel can be processed on its own; recombine them with Channel Join.
- Résumé (FR) : Le nœud channelsplit sépare une couche multicanale en quatre couches Mono, rouge, verte, bleue et alpha, pour les traiter séparément.

- Inputs meaning: ["rgba: the layer, VDB or attribute to split; missing channels follow the standard channel extension rules"]

- Caveats: ["The page documents no parameters", "For swapping channels within one multichannel input, Channel Swap is more efficient", "If only one channel is needed, Channel Extract gives a cleaner network"]

